@block apps.gui
purpose karkas-gui: schema viewer/editor
kind    leaf
thread  main
est     L
call    libs.layout:layout
call    libs.index:view
call    libs.index:update
call    libs.agents:apply_edit
call    libs.code:check_drift
call    libs.metrics:active_runs
call    libs.metrics:request_stop
call    libs.agents:run_target
use     libs.core
inv     the GUI thread never waits for disk or network
inv     idle CPU use stays near zero
inv     clearing a panel writes only .karkas/cleared.json: tickets, journals and logs stay
inv     the chat runs the same karkas commands a user would type
inv     the green triangle runs the same karkas run a user would type; closing the GUI ends the program
inv     a notes project's texts are written only by the human's edits; nothing of a notes project is built or run
